<p class="loom-caption">Costs are API estimates in USD, not subscription charges. Claude uses its recorded list-price estimate; OpenAI uses <a href="https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6.1-sol">Sol</a> and <a href="https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6-astra">Astra</a> standard short-context rates checked 25 October 2026. Cached input is priced separately and reasoning is counted once within output. Request sizes weren't retained, so long-context and other premiums aren't included. Gemini's token accounting is unresolved; its costs and missing usage are left blank.</p>
